        <obo:CLM_0010003 rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CLM_5007649"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000028>CB Glut (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A cerebellum-like structure glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Class:29 CB Glut.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>29 CB Glut</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:comment>Rationale for assigning this type to reference data: Class 29 includes the dorsal cochlear nucleus subclass 315 DCO UBC Glut as well as cerebellar glutamatergic types, so it is mapped to the grouping class covering neurons of the cerebellum and of cerebellum-like structures such as the dorsal cochlear nucleus. Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>cerebellum-like structure glutamatergic neuron (Mmus)</rdfs:label>
