        <obo:IAO_0000028>L2/3 IT PPP Glut (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A L2/3 intratelencephalic projecting glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Cdc14a (Mmus), Satb2 (Mmus), Meis2 (Mmus). Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Subclass:019 L2/3 IT PPP Glut.</obo:IAO_0000115>
