        <obo:IAO_0000028>L5 ET CTX Glut (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A L5 extratelencephalic projecting glutamatergic cortical neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Lratd2 (Mmus), Slc17a7 (Mmus), Fezf2 (Mmus). Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Subclass:022 L5 ET CTX Glut.</obo:IAO_0000115>
