        <obo:IAO_0000028>L6b/CT ENT Glut (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A L6b glutamatergic cortical neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Cplx3 (Mmus), Nxph3 (Mmus), Npr3 (Mmus). Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Subclass:028 L6b/CT ENT Glut.</obo:IAO_0000115>
