        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:nodeID="genid6475"/>
        <rdfs:comment>37 of 41 clusters in this set are called dopaminergic (Th, Slc6a3, Slc18a2, Ddc). The other four lack Th and Slc6a3 in their NT marker evidence and are called Glut-GABA; Gad2, Slc32a1 and Slc17a6 are also expressed by many dopaminergic clusters.</rdfs:comment>
