        <obo:IAO_0000028>CS-RPO Meis2 Gaba (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Otp (Mmus), Bhlhe22 (Mmus), G630016G05Rik (Mmus), Crnde (Mmus), Calb2 (Mmus). Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Subclass:263 CS-RPO Meis2 Gaba.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>263 CS-RPO Meis2 Gaba</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>327 CS-RPO_Otp:Meis2_Gaba</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:comment>Rationale for assigning this type to reference data: Assigned by automated classification (ELK) of a definition built from soma location Pons (P; ≥80% of grey-matter cells in both the Yao 2023 and Zhuang 2023 MERFISH atlases) and neurotransmitter GABA (all clusters) against CL 2026-06-08. Basis: NT. Other inferred CL parents: central nervous system neuron. [WMBO CL promotion round 1, 2026-10-13] Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>CS-RPO Meis2 Gaba GABAergic neuron (Mmus)</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:seeAlso>https://knowledge.brain-map.org/abcatlas#AQIBQVA4Sk5ONUxZQUJHVk1HS1kxQgACUTFOQ1dXUEc2RlowRE5JWEpCUQADBAFGUzAwRFhWMFQ5UjFYOUZKNFFFAAIAAAFRWTVTOEtNTzVITEpVRjBQMDBLAAIBMjYzIENTLVJQTyBNZWlzMiBHYWJhAAABMTVCSzQ3RENJT0YxU0xMVVc5UAACAAABQ0JHQzBVMzBWVjlKUFI2MFRKVQACAAAEAQECgazGjoGWFSADhGpN%%2BAAAABAAACFZGT0ZZUEZRR1JLVURRVVozRkYACUxWREJKQVc4Qkk1WVNTMVFVQkcACgALAVRMT0tXQ0w5NVJVMDNEOVBFVEcAAjczR1ZURFhERUdFMjdNMlhKTVQAAwEEAQACIzAwMDAwMAADyAEABQEBAiMwMDAwMDAAA8gBAAAAAgMA</rdfs:seeAlso>
