        <obo:IAO_0000115>A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Dmbx1 (Mmus), Ebf3 (Mmus), Slc6a5 (Mmus). Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Subclass:287 MV-SPIV-PRP Dmbx1 Gly-Gaba.</obo:IAO_0000115>
