        <obo:IAO_0000028>MV Pax6 Gly-Gaba (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A GABA-Gly neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Pax6 (Mmus), Slc6a5 (Mmus), Neurod2 (Mmus). Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Subclass:294 MV Pax6 Gly-Gaba.</obo:IAO_0000115>
