        <obo:IAO_0000028>L2/3 IT ENT Glut_1 (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A L2/3 intratelencephalic projecting glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Slc13a5 (Mmus), Cyp26b1 (Mmus), Fign (Mmus). Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Supertype:0033 L2/3 IT ENT Glut_1.</obo:IAO_0000115>
