        <obo:IAO_0000028>L2/3 IT ENT Glut_5 (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A L2/3 intratelencephalic projecting glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Fermt1 (Mmus), Qrfpr (Mmus), Kcnip2 (Mmus). Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Supertype:0037 L2/3 IT ENT Glut_5.</obo:IAO_0000115>
