        <obo:IAO_0000028>IT AON-TT-DP Glut_5 (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A intratelencephalic-projecting glutamatergic cortical neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Abi3bp (Mmus), Prss23 (Mmus), C1ql1 (Mmus), Itpka (Mmus). Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Supertype:0050 IT AON-TT-DP Glut_5.</obo:IAO_0000115>
