        <obo:IAO_0000028>HPF CR Glut (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A Cajal-Retzius cell of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Trp73 (Mmus), Cd274 (Mmus). Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Supertype:0135 HPF CR Glut_1.</obo:IAO_0000115>
