        <obo:IAO_0000115>A caudal ganglionic eminence derived interneuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Edaradd (Mmus), Htr3a (Mmus), Adgrg6 (Mmus). Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Supertype:0198 RHP-COA Ndnf Gaba_6.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>0198 RHP-COA Ndnf Gaba_6</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>0212 RHP-COA_Ndnf_Gaba 3</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:comment>Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions. Warning: Despite its name, RHP-COA Ndnf Gaba_6 does not have cells in cortical amygdalar area (COA). This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>RHP-COA Ndnf Gaba_6 caudal ganglionic eminence derived interneuron (Mmus)</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:seeAlso>https://knowledge.brain-map.org/abcatlas#AQIBQVA4Sk5ONUxZQUJHVk1HS1kxQgACUTFOQ1dXUEc2RlowRE5JWEpCUQADBAFGUzAwRFhWMFQ5UjFYOUZKNFFFAAIAAAFRWTVTOEtNTzVITEpVRjBQMDBLAAIAAAExNUJLNDdEQ0lPRjFTTExVVzlQAAIBMDE5OCBSSFAtQ09BIE5kbmYgR2FiYV82AAABQ0JHQzBVMzBWVjlKUFI2MFRKVQACAAAEAQECgazGjoGWFSADhGpN%%2BAAAABAAACFZGT0ZZUEZRR1JLVURRVVozRkYACUxWREJKQVc4Qkk1WVNTMVFVQkcACgALAVRMT0tXQ0w5NVJVMDNEOVBFVEcAAjczR1ZURFhERUdFMjdNMlhKTVQAAwEEAQACIzAwMDAwMAADyAEABQEBAiMwMDAwMDAAA8gBAAAAAgMA</rdfs:seeAlso>
