        <rdfs:comment>Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions. Warning: Despite its name, NDB-SI-MA-STRv Lhx8 Gaba_4 does not have cells in diagonal band nucleus (NDB), magnocellular nucleus (MA). This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>NDB-SI-MA-STRv Lhx8 Gaba_4 medial ganglionic eminence derived interneuron (Mmus)</rdfs:label>
