        <obo:IAO_0000028>RT-ZI Gnb3 Gaba_2 (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Slc22a3 (Mmus), Pvalb (Mmus), Fgf10 (Mmus), Pou6f2 (Mmus). Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Supertype:0432 RT-ZI Gnb3 Gaba_2.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>0432 RT-ZI Gnb3 Gaba_2</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>0480 RT-ZI_Creb5_Gaba 4</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:comment>Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions. Warning: Despite its name, RT-ZI Gnb3 Gaba_2 does not have cells in zona incerta (ZI). This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.</rdfs:comment>
