        <obo:IAO_0000028>PVH-SO-PVa Otp Glut_3 (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Rufy4 (Mmus), Agtr1a (Mmus). Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Supertype:0587 PVH-SO-PVa Otp Glut_3.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>0587 PVH-SO-PVa Otp Glut_3</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>0597 PVH-SO-PVa_Otp:Fezf2_Glut 2</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
