        <obo:IAO_0000028>PVH-SO-PVa Otp Glut_6 (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Ucn3 (Mmus), Trh (Mmus). Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Supertype:0590 PVH-SO-PVa Otp Glut_6.</obo:IAO_0000115>
