        <obo:IAO_0000028>STN-PSTN Pitx2 Glut_2 (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Pitx2 (Mmus), C1ql2 (Mmus), Cdh23 (Mmus). Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Supertype:0599 STN-PSTN Pitx2 Glut_2.</obo:IAO_0000115>
