        <obo:IAO_0000028>PAG-SC Neurod2 Meis2 Glut_4 (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Mybpc1 (Mmus), Otx2os1 (Mmus). Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Supertype:0693 PAG-SC Neurod2 Meis2 Glut_4.</obo:IAO_0000115>
