        <rdfs:comment>Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions. Warning: Despite its name, SCm-PAG Cdh23 Gaba_2 does not have cells in periaqueductal gray (PAG). This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>SCm-PAG Cdh23 Gaba_2 GABAergic neuron (Mmus)</rdfs:label>
