        <obo:IAO_0000028>SNc-VTA-RAmb Foxa1 Dopa_4 (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A midbrain dopaminergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of 9030622O22Rik (Mmus), Cd44 (Mmus), Klhl14 (Mmus), Lepr (Mmus). Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Supertype:0883 SNc-VTA-RAmb Foxa1 Dopa_4.</obo:IAO_0000115>
