        <obo:IAO_0000028>DTN-LDT-IPN Otp Pax3 Gaba_2 (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Vmn1r207-ps (Mmus), Cemip (Mmus). Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Supertype:1070 DTN-LDT-IPN Otp Pax3 Gaba_2.</obo:IAO_0000115>
