        <obo:IAO_0000028>DTN-LDT-IPN Otp Pax3 Gaba_5 (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Pax3 (Mmus), Nhlh1 (Mmus), Kirrel3 (Mmus). Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Supertype:1073 DTN-LDT-IPN Otp Pax3 Gaba_5.</obo:IAO_0000115>
