        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>1124 DTN-LDT-IPN_Otp:Vmn1r209_Gaba 2</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:comment>Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions. Warning: Despite its name, DTN-LDT-IPN Otp Pax3 Gaba_5 does not have cells in dorsal tegmental nucleus (DTN), laterodorsal tegmental nucleus (LDT). This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>DTN-LDT-IPN Otp Pax3 Gaba_5 GABAergic neuron (Mmus)</rdfs:label>
