        <obo:IAO_0000028>RPA Pax6 Hoxb5 Gly-Gaba (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Hoxb5 (Mmus), Tal1 (Mmus), Ebf3 (Mmus). Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Supertype:1116 RPA Pax6 Hoxb5 Gly-Gaba_1.</obo:IAO_0000115>
