        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>Rationale for assigning this type to reference data: Mapping of this cell type is supported by high target purity (~98%) and consistent GABA–glycine neurotransmitter predictions and neurotransmitter agreement. Mapping of this cell type is corroborated by MapMyCells-based bioinformatic analysis of Osorno et al. 2022 and its spatial localization profile. Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions.</owl:annotatedTarget>
