        <obo:CLM_0010003 rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CLM_5001941"/>
        <obo:CLM_0010003 rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CLM_5017161"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000028>L2 IT ENT-po Glut_4 (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A L2 intratelencephalic projecting glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Tmem255b (Mmus), Cpa6 (Mmus), Gpr101 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other L2 IT ENT-po Glut cells by expression of Igfbp6. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a7, Slc17a6). These cells are located in the Retrohippocampal region , in or close to the regions: Entorhinal area, medial part, dorsal zone, layer 1, Entorhinal area, medial part, dorsal zone, layer 2, Entorhinal area, medial part, dorsal zone, layer 3, Entorhinal area, medial part, dorsal zone, layer 5 . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:0191 L2 IT ENT-po Glut_4.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>0054 L2 IT ENT-po Glut_4</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>0056 L2-IT-ENT-po_Glut 3</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>0191 L2 IT ENT-po Glut_4</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:comment>Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>L2 IT ENT-po Glut_4 L2 intratelencephalic projecting glutamatergic neuron (Mmus)</rdfs:label>
