        <obo:IAO_0000028>LSX Prdm12 Slit2 Gaba_6 1700001F09Rik (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A striatum neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of 1700001F09Rik (Mmus), Six3os1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other LSX Prdm12 Slit2 Gaba_6 cells by expression of 1700001F09Rik. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad1, Gad2, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Lateral septal complex, brain , in or close to the regions: Lateral septal nucleus, rostral (rostroventral) part, Septofimbrial nucleus, ventral hippocampal commissure, Triangular nucleus of septum . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:1143 LSX Prdm12 Slit2 Gaba_6.</obo:IAO_0000115>
