        <obo:CLM_0010003 rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CLM_5019308"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000028>LHA-AHN-PVH Otp Trh Glut_4 Pappa2 (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Sim2 (Mmus), Pappa2 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other LHA-AHN-PVH Otp Trh Glut_4 cells by expression of Pappa2. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Ddc, Slc17a6). These cells are located in the Hypothalamus, Pallidum , in or close to the regions: Bed nuclei of the stria terminalis, Dorsomedial nucleus of the hypothalamus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:2338 LHA-AHN-PVH Otp Trh Glut_4.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>2338 LHA-AHN-PVH Otp Trh Glut_4</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>2361 LHA-AHN-PVH_Otp:Trh_Glut 5</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:comment>Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions. Warning: Despite its name, LHA-AHN-PVH Otp Trh Glut_4 Pappa2 does not have cells in lateral hypothalamic area (LHA), paraventricular hypothalamic nucleus (PVH). This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>LHA-AHN-PVH Otp Trh Glut_4 Pappa2 glutamatergic neuron (Mmus)</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:seeAlso>https://knowledge.brain-map.org/abcatlas#%2BDggl%2FA4SgGoeExD3ZBDJOUVRJRTdUQU1QOFBRQUhPNFAABYGvpkqB6awOgaCBR4CS1egGAAcAAAUABgEBAkNCR0MwVTMwVlY5SlBSNjBUSlUAA34AAAAEAAAIVkZPRllQRlFHUktVRFFVWjNGRgAJTFZEQkpBVzhCSTVZU1MxUVVCRwAKAAsBVExPS1dDTDk1UlUwM0Q5UEVURwACNzNHVlREWERFR0UyN00yWEpNVAADAQQBAAIjMDAwMDAwAAPIAQAFAQECIzAwMDAwMAADyAEAAAACAwA%3D</rdfs:seeAlso>
