        <obo:IAO_0000028>PAG Pou4f1 Ebf2 Glut_3 Chrnb3 (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Chrnb3 (Mmus), Pou4f2 (Mmus), Sox6 (Mmus), Bcl11a (Mmus). It is distinguished from other PAG Pou4f1 Ebf2 Glut_3 cells by expression of Sox6, Chrnb3. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a6). These cells are located in the Midbrain , in or close to the regions: Superior colliculus, motor related, intermediate white layer, Superior colliculus, motor related, deep gray layer, Periaqueductal gray . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:3123 PAG Pou4f1 Ebf2 Glut_3.</obo:IAO_0000115>
