        <obo:IAO_0000028>SCs Dmbx1 Gaba_4 Gabrq (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Dmbx1 (Mmus), Gabrq (Mmus), Gcnt4 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other SCs Dmbx1 Gaba_4 cells by expression of Gabrq, Mme. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Midbrain , in or close to the regions: Superior colliculus, motor related, intermediate gray layer, Posterior pretectal nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:3736 SCs Dmbx1 Gaba_4.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>3736 SCs Dmbx1 Gaba_4</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>4254 SCs_Dmbx1:Pax7_Gaba 2</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:comment>Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions. Warning: This type SCs Dmbx1 Gaba_4 Gabrq does not have cells in any of the regions it is named for superior colliculus, sensory related (SCs). The name merely indicates that it is a subtype of more general transcriptomic type that does. This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>SCs Dmbx1 Gaba_4 Gabrq GABAergic neuron (Mmus)</rdfs:label>
