        <obo:IAO_0000115>A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Epyc (Mmus), Otx2os1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other SCs Pax7 Nfia Gaba_2 cells by expression of Epyc. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Midbrain , in or close to the regions: Superior colliculus, superficial gray layer, Superior colliculus, optic layer . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:3751 SCs Pax7 Nfia Gaba_2.</obo:IAO_0000115>
