        <owl:annotatedTarget>A midbrain dopaminergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Npw (Mmus), Gm16551 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other SNc-VTA-RAmb Foxa1 Dopa_4 cells by expression of Gm16551. It is dopaminergic (inferred from expression of Ddc, Slc18a2, Slc6a3, Th, Slc17a6). These cells are located in the Midbrain , in or close to the regions: Periaqueductal gray, Dorsal nucleus raphe . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:3861 SNc-VTA-RAmb Foxa1 Dopa_4.</owl:annotatedTarget>
