        <obo:CLM_0010003 rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CLM_5020880"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000028>MB-MY Tph2 Glut-Sero_6 (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A serotonergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Slc6a4 (Mmus), Tecrl (Mmus). It is distinguished from other MB-HB Sero cells by expression of Tecrl. It is serotonergic (inferred from expression of Ddc, Slc6a4, Tph2, Slc18a2, Slc17a8). These cells are located in the Pons , in or close to the regions: Superior central nucleus raphe, Dorsal tegmental nucleus, Pontine central gray . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:3910 MB-MY Tph2 Glut-Sero_6.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>0893 MB-MY Tph2 Glut-Sero_6</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>3910 MB-MY Tph2 Glut-Sero_6</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>4570 MB-MY_Tph2_Glut-Sero 9</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:comment>Rationale for assigning this type to reference data: Assigned by automated classification (ELK) of a definition built from soma location Pons (P; ≥80% of grey-matter cells in both the Yao 2023 and Zhuang 2023 MERFISH atlases) and neurotransmitter serotonin (all clusters) against CL 2026-06-08. Basis: NT. Other inferred CL parents: central nervous system neuron. [WMBO CL promotion round 1, 2026-10-13] Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions. Warning: This type MB-MY Tph2 Glut-Sero_6 does not have cells in any of the regions it is named for midbrain (MB), medulla (MY). The name merely indicates that it is a subtype of more general transcriptomic type that does. This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>MB-MY Tph2 Glut-Sero_6 serotonergic neuron (Mmus)</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:seeAlso>https://knowledge.brain-map.org/abcatlas#AQIBQVA4Sk5ONUxZQUJHVk1HS1kxQgACUTFOQ1dXUEc2RlowRE5JWEpCUQADBAFGUzAwRFhWMFQ5UjFYOUZKNFFFAAIAAAFRWTVTOEtNTzVITEpVRjBQMDBLAAIAAAExNUJLNDdEQ0lPRjFTTExVVzlQAAIBMDg5MyBNQi1NWSBUcGgyIEdsdXQtU2Vyb182AAABQ0JHQzBVMzBWVjlKUFI2MFRKVQACAAAEAQECgazGjoGWFSADhGpN%%2BAAAABAAACFZGT0ZZUEZRR1JLVURRVVozRkYACUxWREJKQVc4Qkk1WVNTMVFVQkcACgALAVRMT0tXQ0w5NVJVMDNEOVBFVEcAAjczR1ZURFhERUdFMjdNMlhKTVQAAwEEAQACIzAwMDAwMAADyAEABQEBAiMwMDAwMDAAA8gBAAAAAgMA</rdfs:seeAlso>
