        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>4780 PRNc-NI-SG-RPO_Vsx2:Nr4a3:Zfhx4_Glut 3</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:comment>Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions. Warning: Despite its name, PRNc-NI-SG-RPO Vsx2 Nr4a2 Glut_2 Pdgfd does not have cells in supragenual nucleus (SG), nucleus raphe pontis (RPO). This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.</rdfs:comment>
