        <rdfs:comment>Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions. Warning: Despite its name, MV-SPIV Slc6a2 Glut_1 Scn7a does not have cells in spinal vestibular nucleus (SPIV). This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.</rdfs:comment>
