        <obo:IAO_0000028>NTS Dbh Glut_6 (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of 4930469K13Rik (Mmus), Colq (Mmus), Tacr3 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other NTS Dbh Glut cells by expression of Rspo2, Hoxa5. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a6, Ddc). These cells are located in the brain . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:4550 NTS Dbh Glut_6.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>1000 NTS_Dbh:Etv1_Glut-NE 4</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>1009 NTS Dbh Glut_6</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>4550 NTS Dbh Glut_6</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:comment>Rationale for assigning this type to reference data: Assigned by automated classification (ELK) of a definition built from soma location Medulla (MY; ≥80% of grey-matter cells in both the Yao 2023 and Zhuang 2023 MERFISH atlases) and neurotransmitter glutamate (all clusters) against CL 2026-06-08. Basis: NT. Other inferred CL parents: central nervous system neuron. [WMBO CL promotion round 1, 2026-10-13] Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions. Warning: This type NTS Dbh Glut_6 does not have cells in any of the regions it is named for nucleus of the solitary tract (NTS). The name merely indicates that it is a subtype of more general transcriptomic type that does. This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>NTS Dbh Glut_6 glutamatergic neuron (Mmus)</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:seeAlso>https://knowledge.brain-map.org/abcatlas#%2BDggl%2FA4SgGoeExD3ZBDJOUVRJRTdUQU1QOFBRQUhPNFAABYGvpkqB6awOgaCBR4CS1egGAAcAAAUABgEBAjE1Qks0N0RDSU9GMVNMTFVXOVAAA34AAAAEAAAIVkZPRllQRlFHUktVRFFVWjNGRgAJTFZEQkpBVzhCSTVZU1MxUVVCRwAKAAsBVExPS1dDTDk1UlUwM0Q5UEVURwACNzNHVlREWERFR0UyN00yWEpNVAADAQQBAAIjMDAwMDAwAAPIAQAFAQECIzAwMDAwMAADyAEAAAACAwA%3D</rdfs:seeAlso>
