        <obo:CLM_0010003 rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CLM_5021533"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000028>VCO Mafa Meis2 Glut_3 Ccdc141 (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Cryba2 (Mmus), Myocd (Mmus), Asb2 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other VCO Mafa Meis2 Glut_3 cells by expression of Ccdc141, Cryba2. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a7, Slc17a6). These cells are located in the Medulla, Cerebellum , in or close to the regions: Ventral cochlear nucleus, Flocculus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:4563 VCO Mafa Meis2 Glut_3.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>4563 VCO Mafa Meis2 Glut_3</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>5289 VCO_Mafa:Meis2_Glut 3</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:comment>Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>VCO Mafa Meis2 Glut_3 Ccdc141 glutamatergic neuron (Mmus)</rdfs:label>
