        <obo:CLM_0010003 rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CLM_5021917"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000028>MV-SPIV-PRP Dmbx1 Gly-Gaba_2 Slc6a2 (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Slc6a2 (Mmus), Dmbx1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other MV-SPIV-PRP Dmbx1 Gly-Gaba_2 cells by expression of Slc6a2. It is GABAergic and glycinergic (inferred from expression of Slc6a5, Slc32a1, Slc6a2, Gad2, Gad1). These cells are located in the Medulla, brain , in or close to the regions: choroid plexus, fourth ventricle, Medial vestibular nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:4947 MV-SPIV-PRP Dmbx1 Gly-Gaba_2.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>4947 MV-SPIV-PRP Dmbx1 Gly-Gaba_2</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>6343 MV-PRP_Dmbx1:Meis2_Gly-Gaba 1</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:comment>Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions. Warning: Despite its name, MV-SPIV-PRP Dmbx1 Gly-Gaba_2 Slc6a2 does not have cells in spinal vestibular nucleus (SPIV), nucleus prepositus (PRP). This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>MV-SPIV-PRP Dmbx1 Gly-Gaba_2 Slc6a2 GABAergic neuron (Mmus)</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:seeAlso>https://knowledge.brain-map.org/abcatlas#AQIBQVA4Sk5ONUxZQUJHVk1HS1kxQgACUTFOQ1dXUEc2RlowRE5JWEpCUQADBAFGUzAwRFhWMFQ5UjFYOUZKNFFFAAIAAAFRWTVTOEtNTzVITEpVRjBQMDBLAAIAAAExNUJLNDdEQ0lPRjFTTExVVzlQAAIAAAFDQkdDMFUzMFZWOUpQUjYwVEpVAAIBNDk0NyBNVi1TUElWLVBSUCBEbWJ4MSBHbHktR2FiYV8yAAAEAQECgazGjoGWFSADhGpN%%2BAAAABAAACFZGT0ZZUEZRR1JLVURRVVozRkYACUxWREJKQVc4Qkk1WVNTMVFVQkcACgALAVRMT0tXQ0w5NVJVMDNEOVBFVEcAAjczR1ZURFhERUdFMjdNMlhKTVQAAwEEAQACIzAwMDAwMAADyAEABQEBAiMwMDAwMDAAA8gBAAAAAgMA</rdfs:seeAlso>
