        <obo:IAO_0000028>CB Granule Glut_1 Lmx1a (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A cerebellar granule cell of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Gabra6 (Mmus), Lmx1a (Mmus), Rnf182 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other CB Granule Glut_1 cells by expression of Lmx1a, Rnf182. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a7). These cells are located in the Medulla, Cerebellum, brain , in or close to the regions: Flocculus, Dorsal cochlear nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:5197 CB Granule Glut_1.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>5197 CB Granule Glut_1</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>6495 CB_Granule_Glut 1</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:comment>Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>CB Granule Glut_1 Lmx1a cerebellar granule cell (Mmus)</rdfs:label>
