        <obo:IAO_0000028>Astro-NT NN_2 Fam227b (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A astrocyte of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Slc7a10 (Mmus), Cyp26b1 (Mmus), Igfbp2 (Mmus), Shroom3 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other Astro-NT NN_2 cells by expression of Fam227b, Shroom3. These cells are located in the Midbrain, Medulla, Pons . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:5216 Astro-NT NN_2.</obo:IAO_0000115>
