        <obo:IAO_0000028>Astro-NT NN_2 Gm30524 (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A astrocyte of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Aqp4 (Mmus), A330076C08Rik (Mmus), Fbln5 (Mmus), Mdga2 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other Astro-NT NN_2 cells by expression of Gm30524. These cells are located in the Medulla, Cerebellum, brain , in or close to the regions: Ventral cochlear nucleus, arbor vitae . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:5217 Astro-NT NN_2.</obo:IAO_0000115>
