        <obo:IAO_0000028>Astro-TE NN_4 (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A astrocyte of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of S1pr1 (Mmus), Thbs4 (Mmus), Gm29683 (Mmus), Slc39a12 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other Astro-TE NN cells by expression of Gm29683. These cells are located in the Cortical subplate, brain , in or close to the regions: Lateral amygdalar nucleus, external capsule . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:5228 Astro-TE NN_4.</obo:IAO_0000115>
