        <obo:IAO_0000028>Astro-TE NN_5 Adamts18 (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A astrocyte of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of S1pr1 (Mmus), Adamts18 (Mmus), Crym (Mmus). It is distinguished from other Astro-TE NN_5 cells by expression of Adamts18. These cells are located in the Lateral septal complex, Striatum dorsal region, brain , in or close to the regions: Nucleus accumbens, Caudoputamen, lateral ventricle . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:5230 Astro-TE NN_5.</obo:IAO_0000115>
