        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A choroid plexus epithelial cell of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of 2900040C04Rik (Mmus), Tbc1d1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other CHOR NN cells by expression of Tbc1d1. These cells are located in the Cerebellum, brain , in or close to the regions: Paraflocculus, choroid plexus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:5264 CHOR NN_1.</owl:annotatedTarget>
