        <obo:IAO_0000028>COP NN_1 Vwc2 (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A committed oligodendrocyte precursor of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of 9630013A20Rik (Mmus), Rab32 (Mmus), Opalin (Mmus). It is distinguished from other COP NN_1 cells by expression of Vwc2, Opalin. These cells are located in the brain . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:5276 COP NN_1.</obo:IAO_0000115>
