        <obo:IAO_0000028>NFOL NN_2 9630013A20Rik (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A newly formed oligodendrocyte of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of 9630013A20Rik (Mmus), Grin2b (Mmus). It is distinguished from other NFOL NN_2 cells by expression of 9630013A20Rik, Grin2b. These cells are located in the Midbrain, Thalamus, brain . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:5278 NFOL NN_2.</obo:IAO_0000115>
