        <obo:IAO_0000028>VLMC NN_2 Srpx2 (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A vascular leptomeningeal cell of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Igf2 (Mmus), Srpx2 (Mmus), Tln2 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other VLMC NN_2 cells by expression of Srpx2, Slc7a11, Tln2. These cells are located in the Isocortex, Cerebellum, brain . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:5301 VLMC NN_2.</obo:IAO_0000115>
