        <obo:IAO_0000028>VLMC NN_4 (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A vascular leptomeningeal cell of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Col1a1 (Mmus), Angptl1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other VLMC NN cells by expression of Angptl1. These cells are located in the Hypothalamus, brain , in or close to the regions: Median eminence, Arcuate hypothalamic nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:5303 VLMC NN_4.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>1190 VLMC NN_4</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>5303 VLMC NN_4</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
