        <obo:IAO_0000028>Peri NN_1 Sod3 (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A brain pericyte of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Vtn (Mmus), Rgs5 (Mmus), Slc22a8 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other Peri NN cells by expression of Sod3. These cells are located in the Isocortex, brain . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:5304 Peri NN_1.</obo:IAO_0000115>
