        <owl:annotatedTarget>A microglial cell of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of C1qa (Mmus), Tmem119 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other Immune cells by expression of C1qa, Tmem119. These cells are located in the Isocortex, brain . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:5312 Microglia NN_1.</owl:annotatedTarget>
